        "original_id": "e2d4e6e1-bbd5-56cf-9733-100ae627b8f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Viktor Belenko, John Barron\n- Works: MiG Pilot: The Final Escape of Lieutenant Belenko\n- Events: Viktor Belenko's 1976 defection\n- Places: United States, Hakodate, Japan\n- Organizations: Soviet Union, West\n\nFacts:\n- Viktor Ivanovich Belenko was born on 15 February 1947.\n- In 1976, Soviet MiG-25 fighter pilot Viktor Belenko defected to the West while flying his Mikoyan-Gurevich MiG-25 'Foxbat' and landed in Hakodate, Japan.\n- Viktor Belenko's 1976 defection was to the United States.\n- In 1980, John Barron published MiG Pilot: The Final Escape of Lieutenant Belenko, a biography about Viktor Belenko's life and defection.",
